## What this does and does not cover

It covers the labels: the intent assigned to each message id by each labelling
pass, together with the model, prompt revision and shot count that produced it.

It does not cover the underlying message texts. Benchmark A's messages come from
Banking77 and benchmark B's from CLINC150; both are public datasets distributed
under their own terms, and this repository does not redistribute the pool or test
splits used in the competition. A few audit files quote the text of sampled pool
messages for context; those quotations remain subject to the source datasets'
licences.
